<a:Name>注册与登录</a:Name>
<a:Code>注册与登录</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1751005408</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>成员D</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1751043410</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>31049</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Users register with their student numbers. The system automatically generates a unique virtual ID, and the real information is not displayed on the front end.
Student numbers are encrypted and stored via SHA-256 and are only used for school linkage in emergency situations.</a:Comment>
</o:UseCase>
